{"id": "34906", "title": "继父", "author": "林和平", "category": "文学名著", "count": 60, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34906/34906s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34906.htm", "intro": "在特殊的年代里，四个孩子与继父为仇，几次把他赶出家门，还欲将其置于死地。他却忍辱负重，支撑着一个坎坷曲折、灾难不断的家。孩子们长大了，懂得了继父的含辛茹苦，当他们要报答养育之恩的时候，继父却倒下了。站在继父的墓前，孩子们凝视着那“恩重如山”的墓碑，思绪万千……这是作家林和平继《血色残阳》之后奉献给读者的又一部力作。由李幼斌主演的同名电视连续剧正在全国各地热播^……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34906", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2309810.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2309811.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2309812.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2309813.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2309814.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2309815.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2309816.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2309817.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2309818.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2309819.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2309820.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2309821.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2309822.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2309823.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2309824.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2309825.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2309826.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2309827.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2309828.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2309829.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2309830.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2309831.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2309832.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2309833.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2309834.ht